      {
        "Patch": "March 12, 2013",
        "Type": "Update",
        "Description": "Reworked the Wall Breaker AI to avoid \"decoys and distractions\", but also increased its housing space to 2 (from 1). The AI change annulled the \"spiking\" tactic, a strategy where individual protruding walls were placed ahead of the main line of walls to attract Wall Breakers."
      },
